    "(removed on GitHub)" : {

    },
    "**Check Links** asks each site your posts link to whether the page is still there." : {

    },
    "**Code** opens layouts, includes and stylesheets for anything the panels do not cover. The preview follows every change." : {

    },
    "**Health** looks over the whole site: properties that will not build, two files at one address, links and images that go nowhere, missing alt text, large files, and the basics search engines and link previews need." : {

    },
    "**Photos** keeps a photo stream: one small file per photo, each with a caption. **Media** lists every image in the site, where it is used, and which ones nothing uses." : {

    },
    "**Properties** above the text hold the title, date and the section’s other fields. A date in the future schedules the post. **Search and sharing** sets the description and picture used in search results and link previews." : {

    },
    "**Publish** (⇧⌘P) checks the post, then sends it and its new pictures to GitHub as one change. Inkwell shows when GitHub Pages has the new version live." : {

    },
    "**Theme & Style** switches between Inkwell’s themes and edits colours, fonts and layout. **Navigation** edits the menu; **Settings** the site’s title, description, favicon, share image and custom domain." : {

    },
    "**Version History…** shows earlier versions of a post, and can bring one back." : {

